<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Schematic Name="CenterTapTransformer Power Conservation" Description="Ideal transformer driven through a finite source impedance (Rsrc, standing in for a real tube plate resistance): power into PA/PC must equal power dissipated in the two secondary-half loads, for any turns ratio and any load. A regression test for the ampere-turns equation (see CenterTapTransformer.cs) -- Rsrc is what makes the bug externally visible in this topology; see the generator script comments for why an ideal-source topology cannot detect it." PartNumber="">
